== Aurifeuillian factors and base 904 <sec-dio-aurifeuille>

#theorem(id: "thm-aurifeuille", title: "The ratio of Aurifeuillian factors", src: "16.1")[
  For squarefree odd $x > 1$, the Aurifeuillian factors $L < M$ of $x^x plus.minus 1$ satisfy $ln(M slash L) = 2 sum psi(j) slash (j x^((j-1) slash 2))$, the sum over odd $j >= 1$ prime to $x$, with $psi$ the quadratic character of $QQ(sqrt(x))$. In particular $M slash L -> e^2$.
]

